  "flavor": "any",
  "source": {
    "name": "wow-config starter",
    "url": "https://github.com/rymiwe/wow-config",
    "credit": "wow-config (common keyboard-turning-free setup)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Every key points at a slot on the main action bar, so it works for any class. Drag your most-pressed spells to slots 1-4.",
    "A and D strafe instead of turning, so you never need to hold the mouse to turn while fighting.",
    "Mouse 4 and 5 hold defensives (slots 10 and 11). Middle-click is slot 12."
  ],
